{"id":"7b6b88ff367ba588","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-df-zfc-algebra2-module-basis.md","title":"ZFC Algebra2 Module Basis","display":"df-zfc-algebra2-module-basis — ZFC Algebra2 Module Basis","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-algebra2-module-basis","aliases":["58-df-zfc-algebra2-module-basis"],"display":"df-zfc-algebra2-module-basis — ZFC Algebra2 Module Basis","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch13/58-df-module]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function]]","[[../batch04/58-df-finite]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-algebra2-module-basis"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-algebra2-module-basis</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-algebra2-module-basis — ZFC Algebra2 Module Basis"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ef3a5dd6825f0373\" href=\"?note=ef3a5dd6825f0373\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-module\">../batch13/58-df-module</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function\">../batch16/58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-finite\">../batch04/58-df-finite</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R,M\\in V\">\\(R,M\\in V\\)</span> (ring and module carriers)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot\">\\(+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot\\)</span> (designated left-module operations)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\in V\">\\(B\\in V\\)</span> (candidate basis)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Module}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Module}_S\\)</span> (structured left-module predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ef3a5dd6825f0373\" href=\"?note=ef3a5dd6825f0373\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-module\">../batch13/58-df-module</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Finite}\">\\(\\mathrm{Finite}\\)</span> (finite-set predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-finite\">../batch04/58-df-finite</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2ModuleBasis}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2ModuleBasis}_S\\)</span> (module-basis predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}algebra2\\text{-}module\\text{-}basis}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2ModuleBasis}_S(B;M,R,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Module}_S(M,R,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot)\\land B\\subseteq M\\land\n\\forall m\\in M\\;\\exists!c\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(c,B,R)\\land\n\\mathrm{Finite}(\\{b\\in B:c(b)\\neq0_R\\})\\land\nm=\\sum_{\\substack{b\\in B\\\\c(b)\\neq0_R}}c(b)\\odot b\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}algebra2\\text{-}module\\text{-}basis}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2ModuleBasis}_S(B;M,R,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Module}_S(M,R,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot)\\land B\\subseteq M\\land\n\\forall m\\in M\\;\\exists!c\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(c,B,R)\\land\n\\mathrm{Finite}(\\{b\\in B:c(b)\\neq0_R\\})\\land\nm=\\sum_{\\substack{b\\in B\\\\c(b)\\neq0_R}}c(b)\\odot b\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-module","status":"resolved","id":"ef3a5dd6825f0373","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-module]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-finite","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a3598","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-finite]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-module","status":"resolved","id":"ef3a5dd6825f0373","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Module}_S$ (structured left-module predicate, see [[../batch13/58-df-module]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-finite","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a3598","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Finite}$ (finite-set predicate, see [[../batch04/58-df-finite]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"R,M\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot","display":false},{"tex":"B\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Module}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Finite}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2ModuleBasis}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\ma